        <mxCell id="wifi" value="&lt;b&gt;WiFiTask (Lea)&lt;/b&gt; NEW, stack 512 words&lt;br&gt;Done: Wi-Fi driver ported (es_wifi, wifi.c)&lt;br&gt;Done: connect hotspot + TCP to phone (with retry)&lt;br&gt;Done: get &quot;SET &amp;lt;study&amp;gt; &amp;lt;break&amp;gt;&quot;,&lt;br&gt;check format / range / IDLE (HandlePhoneCommand)&lt;br&gt;Done: xQueueSend SET_TIME, reply OK / ERROR&lt;br&gt;Done: read state with mutex, send &quot;STATE: ...&quot;&lt;br&gt;to phone only when it changes" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#7a3e9d;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
